{"symbol":"QUESTFLOW","yahoo":"QUESTFLOW.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"name":"Quest Flow Controls Limited","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Specialty Industrial Machinery","website":"https://www.questflowcontrols.com","about":"Quest Flow Controls Limited assembles, buys, sells, distributes, imports, exports, or deals in valves, actuators, strainers, and remote-control valves systems to various industries in India and internationally. It offers control cabinets, tanks, visualization systems, piping products, pumps, fittings, gaskets, flanges, and measurement devices. The company is also involved in the installation, maintaining, servicing, or handling of equipment and services that control and manage its products, as well as manufacturing of special purpose machinery. In addition, it offers butterfly, ball, gate, check, globe, storm, quick closing, and self closing valves, IPMS-compatible valves and type-tested alloy steel valves. It supplies its products to marine / defense, pulp and paper, water and wastewater, mining, power, oil and gas, chemical / petrochemical, food and beverage, and industrial gases industries. The company was formerly known as Meson Valves India Limited and changed its name to Quest Flow Controls Limited in June 2025. Quest Flow Controls Limited was founded in 2003 and is based in Pune, India.","updated":"2026-09-26T06:50:32+00:00","quote":{"price":167.3,"prevClose":164.6,"marketCap":171.62,"high52":288.75,"low52":116.2,"pe":null,"bookValue":79.84,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":-5.77,"shares":1.0258,"insiders":41.86,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2023-09-21","2023-09-22","2023-09-25","2023-09-26","2023-09-27","2023-09-28","2023-09-29","2023-10-03","2023-10-04","2023-10-05","2023-10-06","2023-10-09","2023-10-10","2023-10-11","2023-10-12","2023-10-13","2023-10-16","2023-10-17","2023-10-18","2023-10-19","2023-10-20","2023-10-23","2023-10-25","2023-10-26","2023-10-27","2023-10-30","2023-10-31","2023-11-01","2023-11-02","2023-11-03","2023-11-06"